{"pageProps":{"page":{"ID":2118,"post_author":"14","post_date":"February 20, 2026","post_date_gmt":"2026-02-20 12:23:27","post_title":"Careers","post_status":"publish","comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","post_name":"careers","post_modified":"2026-05-07 14:26:54","post_modified_gmt":"2026-05-07 14:26:54","guid":"https://pylon-two.vercel.app/?page_id=2118","post_type":"page","filter":"raw","url":"https://pylon-two.vercel.app/careers/","header_options":{"header_theme":"white"},"body_color":"grey","sections":[{"acf_fc_layout":"section","components":[{"acf_fc_layout":"mastheads","Mastheads":[{"acf_fc_layout":"careers_masthead","heading":"This will be hard","story":{"paragraph":"<p>Mortgages have failed America.</p>\n<p>The mortgage market is $13T but the infrastructure underneath it hasn’t changed in decades. The way loans are manufactured, priced, and delivered is inefficient and expensive. And that cost gets passed to borrowers every single time.</p>\n<p>Billions have been poured into vertical SaaS, point solutions, and digital front ends. None of it touched the real problem. It actually made origination more expensive.</p>\n<p>When we decided to rebuild mortgage infrastructure from the ground up and to turn mortgage into an API call, people thought we were out of our minds. Some still do. We&#8217;ve learned to run on that kind of doubt.</p>\n<p>Pylon is not a typical fintech company. We don’t come from the mortgage industry. We came in from the outside, got obsessed with the problem, and built something the industry said couldn&#8217;t be built. We&#8217;re opinionated, ship fast, and say what we think. We don&#8217;t have patience for the way things have always been done.</p>\n<p>If you&#8217;re the kind of person who does their best work when the problem is hard and the stakes are real, this is your place.</p>\n<p>Join us.</p>\n"},"carousel":[{"image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/palo-alto.jpg","alt":"palo alto","width":1024,"height":801}},{"image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/team.jpg","alt":"team","width":5712,"height":4284}},{"image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/flatiron.jpg","alt":"flatiron","width":1000,"height":1500}},{"image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Frame-1948759635.jpg","alt":"Frame 1948759635","width":1962,"height":1251}},{"image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/office-1.jpg","alt":"office","width":900,"height":1350}},{"image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/meeting.jpg","alt":"meeting","width":4260,"height":2571}}],"locations":[{"location":"Palo Alto"},{"location":"New York"}]}]}],"padding_top":"large","padding_bottom":"large","inner_spacing":"medium","background":{"background_color":"white"},"change_to":"black"},{"acf_fc_layout":"section","components":[{"acf_fc_layout":"content","content":[{"acf_fc_layout":"icon_grid","gap":"64","items":[{"icon":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/profile.svg","alt":"profile","width":104,"height":104},"heading":"Customer obsession","content":"<p>Hold yourself and others accountable to overdelivering for our customers. They are our top priority.</p>\n"},{"icon":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/graph.svg","alt":"graph","width":104,"height":104},"heading":"Outcomes over optics","content":"<p>Bring a relentless focus on outputs to ensure you’re doing the work that matters most. We’re allergic to incrementalism and window dressing.</p>\n"},{"icon":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/chat-alert.svg","alt":"chat alert","width":104,"height":104},"heading":"Contrarian and correct","content":"<p>Be highly opinionated and be right more than you’re wrong. We default to first principles and have a bias toward questioning industry consensus.</p>\n"},{"icon":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/ruler.svg","alt":"ruler","width":104,"height":104},"heading":"Craftsmanship in everything","content":"<p>Obsess over the details. The real estate economy depends on the infrastructure we’re building, so every pixel and every line of code matters.</p>\n"}],"icon_size":"large"}]}],"padding_top":"large","padding_bottom":"large","inner_spacing":"medium","background":{"background_color":"white"},"change_to":"black","rail_eyebrow":"Values"},{"acf_fc_layout":"section","components":[{"acf_fc_layout":"content","content":[{"acf_fc_layout":"two_col_text_asset","variant":"652-540","text_card":{"heading":"Engineering at Pylon","content":"<p>Mortgages might be the hardest problem in all of tech. Real money, real stakes, real regulatory complexity. Many have tried and failed.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>At Pylon, we’re vertically integrating the whole mortgage stack. Our engineers own entire systems, not tickets. We leverage AI+ML and operations research to solve the messy, real-world challenges everyone else calls impossible.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>If you want to build infrastructure that actually moves the American economy, join us.</p>\n","options":{"section_alignment":"left","text_alignment":"left","mobile_text_alignment":"left","subheading_type":"default","subheading_tag":"h6","heading_tag":"h2","heading_font_size":"42","content_font_size":"18","top_link_spacing":"default"}},"asset":{"type":[{"acf_fc_layout":"coded_visual","id":"cube"}]},"options":{"reverse":true,"add_list":true,"list_layout":"list"}}]}],"padding_top":"large","padding_bottom":"large","inner_spacing":"medium","background":{"background_color":"paleGrey"},"change_to":"black","rail_eyebrow":"engineering"},{"acf_fc_layout":"section","components":[{"acf_fc_layout":"content","content":[{"acf_fc_layout":"icon_grid","gap":"64","items":[{"icon":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/hammer.svg","alt":"hammer","width":104,"height":104},"heading":"30% former founders"},{"icon":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/stripe.svg","alt":"stripe","width":104,"height":104},"heading":"Many ex-Stripes"},{"icon":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/revenue-growth.svg","alt":"revenue growth","width":104,"height":104},"heading":"2x MoM revenue growth"}],"icon_size":"large"}]}],"padding_top":"small","padding_bottom":"small","inner_spacing":"medium","background":{"background_color":"white"},"change_to":"black"},{"acf_fc_layout":"section","components":[{"acf_fc_layout":"text_card","text_card":{"heading":"Benefits","options":{"section_alignment":"left","text_alignment":"left","mobile_text_alignment":"left","subheading_type":"default","subheading_tag":"h6","heading_tag":"h2","heading_font_size":"42","content_font_size":"18","top_link_spacing":"default"}}},{"acf_fc_layout":"content","content":[{"acf_fc_layout":"icon_grid","gap":"64","items":[{"icon":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/ChartPieSlice.svg","alt":"ChartPieSlice","width":24,"height":24},"heading":"Substantial ownership","content":"<p>Be a founder, not just an employee, with meaningful ownership in Pylon.</p>\n"},{"icon":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/ShieldPlus.svg","alt":"ShieldPlus","width":24,"height":24},"heading":"Health, dental, and vision","content":"<p>Stay healthy with comprehensive coverage for you and your dependents.</p>\n"},{"icon":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/home.svg","alt":"home","width":24,"height":24},"heading":"Home financing","content":"<p>Get access to Pylon’s industry-leading rates for financing or refinancing your home.</p>\n"},{"icon":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/piggy.svg","alt":"piggy","width":24,"height":24},"heading":"Financial planning support","content":"<p>Be prepared for what the future brings with 401(k) and life insurance options.</p>\n"}],"icon_size":"small"}]}],"padding_top":"large","padding_bottom":"large","inner_spacing":"small","background":{"background_color":"white"},"change_to":"black","rail_eyebrow":"Benefits"},{"acf_fc_layout":"section","components":[{"acf_fc_layout":"special_blocks","special_blocks":[{"acf_fc_layout":"careers","benefits":{"heading":"Benefits","benefits":[{"icon":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/ChartPieSlice.svg","alt":"ChartPieSlice","width":24,"height":24},"heading":"Substantial ownership","content":"Be a founder, not just an employee, with meaningful ownership in Pylon."},{"icon":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/ShieldPlus.svg","alt":"ShieldPlus","width":24,"height":24},"heading":"Health, dental, and vision","content":"Stay healthy with comprehensive coverage for you and your dependents."},{"icon":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/home.svg","alt":"home","width":24,"height":24},"heading":"Home financing","content":"Get access to Pylon’s industry-leading rates for financing or refinancing your home."},{"icon":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/SunHorizon.svg","alt":"SunHorizon","width":24,"height":24},"heading":"Annual off-sites","content":"Enjoy company-wide trips to scenic locations to get to know your teammates better."},{"icon":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/piggy.svg","alt":"piggy","width":24,"height":24},"heading":"Financial planning support","content":"Be prepared for what the future brings with 401(k) and life insurance options."}]},"open_positions":{"heading":"Open positions"}}]}],"id":"openings","padding_top":"large","padding_bottom":"large","inner_spacing":"medium","background":{"background_color":"white"},"change_to":"black","rail_eyebrow":"Openings"}],"footer_options":{"remove_cta":true},"seo